---
import SiteLayout from "../../../layouts/SiteLayout.astro";
import release from "../../../data/release.json";
---

<SiteLayout
  title="Roadmap — Burnished Sky Ahead"
  description="Creator-curated public roadmap for future Burnished Sky Ahead updates."
  current="roadmap"
>
  <div class="page-shell">
    <header class="page-intro">
      <p class="eyebrow">Built in public, released for everyone</p>
      <h1>Roadmap</h1>
      <p class="lede">Downloads, Store reviews, support messages, and optional Tips help guide a creator-curated roadmap. Reaching a milestone begins development of a future free update.</p>
    </header>
    <section class="content-grid">
      <aside>Release milestones</aside>
      <div class="prose">
        <div class="callout">
          <p>Milestones do not promise a delivery date and do not grant an individual entitlement, vote, or priority response.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="milestone-list">
          {release.milestones.map((milestone) => (
            <article class="milestone">
              <div class="milestone-id">{milestone.id}</div>
              <div>
                <strong>{milestone.downloads.toLocaleString("en-US")} downloads</strong><br />
                <span>or US${milestone.supportUsd} in support</span><br />
                <span class="status-tag">{milestone.status}</span>
              </div>
              <div>
                <h3>{milestone.feature}</h3>
                <p>A future free update for every user once the feature is designed, tested, and safe to release.</p>
              </div>
            </article>
          ))}
        </div>
        <h2>How decisions are made</h2>
        <p>
          devjoe sets the milestones and final scope while actively reading Store
          reviews and messages from supporters. Aggregate progress is updated
          manually. Supporter names and messages remain private unless the person
          explicitly approves publication.
        </p>
        <p>States move from Locked → Unlocked → In design → In testing → Released.</p>
      </div>
    </section>
  </div>
</SiteLayout>
